{"id":"bca97838-e4b5-4074-b24f-7b61bcb16c86","object":"chat.completion","created":1793243824,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\": \"I have now read the required mechanisms from all three files. Let me write a cross-file note grounded in the exposed evidence, then proceed to baseline pytest.\", \"code\": \"write_note(title=\\\"Cross-module log budget mechanisms\\\", content=\\\"environ.py: EnvVar is a non-data descriptor with __slots__ ('name','init','lock'); __get__ takes self.lock, checks owner.__dict__.get(self.name, self), returns cached value if not self, else calls self.init(os.getenv(self.name)); exceptions are re-raised as type(e)(f'{self.name}: {e}') with TypeError fallback. Factory methods like int_or_none return EnvVar(lambda v: int(v) if v is not None else None). rearm(name) does setattr(envs, name, _descriptors[name]); rearm_all loops over _descriptors and does the same. New config must follow this pattern and validate >=32 with ValueError naming the variable. logger.py: NewLineFormatter.__init__(fmt, datefmt=None, high_precision=False, use_color=False) calls super then sets attributes. format(record) calls super().format(record), then if '\\\\\\\\n' in msg and record.message inserts prefix after each newline; color applied last. _setup_logger builds a global _default_handler only if None, adds it to root, then always creates a new NewLineFormatter(_FORMAT, datefmt=_DATE_FORMAT, use_color=sys.stdout.isatty()) and sets it on the handler. init_logger sets level DEBUG; for deepinfer-prefixed names sets propagate True (reusing root handler), otherwise False and adds the default handler if not present. stats_logger.py: from deepinfer.logger import init_logger; logger = init_logger(__name__). _emit_logs(self, msgs) does self._log_queue.put(msgs). _log_worker(q) iterates q.get until None, sleeps based on dist.get_rank()%8 if need_sleep, then for m in msgs: logger.info(m); then need_sleep = q.empty(); exceptions use traceback.print_exc(). The keep_full_message=True extra must be added at logger.info in _log_worker.\\\", evidence_ids=[\\\"ev-246c6e73a88cb2c9edc3\\\", \\\"ev-8554ade850ecb397d235\\\", \\\"ev-ef45633e339c9e5fd82f\\\", \\\"ev-30754515034e43628968\\\", \\\"ev-51e2fa3b9fc1aebe86f3\\\", \\\"ev-d69c220908cefeeae7f2\\\", \\\"ev-ddb5be78a5cf6218d616\\\", \\\"ev-c8859274b7c70879ff16\\\", \\\"ev-5a3c8c1ca1246b61b813\\\", \\\"ev-5abfdabfb975754c6683\\\"], section=\\\"source\\\")\"}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8421,"completion_tokens":641,"total_tokens":9062,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5376},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":5376,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":3045},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}